astructure has emerged to challenge him. A Libertarian and an independent are also on the ballot, but neither appears positioned to alter the outcome. The forecast treats this as a Safe Republican hold.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.0084, "margin": -18.82}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.0066, "margin": -20.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.0073, "margin": -20.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.0079, "margin": -20.0}]}